<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 588.77, up 0.11.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 285 to 244.</p>
<p>The average price per share was unchanged.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 20,900,230 compared with 19,939,810 on Thursday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
